<title>POLAND: Polish central bank sells PLN 260 mln of NBP-bills.</title>
<headline>Polish central bank sells PLN 260 mln of NBP-bills.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland sold 92 million zlotys of its 91-day NBP-bills and 168 million zlotys of 182-day NBP-bills, the central bank said.</p>
<p>The bank sold the shorter paper at an unchanged average yield of 21.99 percent and the average yield for the 182-day bills was also unchanged at 22.00 percent.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 2 653 9700</p>
</text>
